// Harvesters under fire raise a defence call before any structure is hit (WP9.3a-1, docs/rules/ai.md "Escalation and the harvester threat (WP9.3a-1)"):
// the AI of the variant profile `ai_harvest_raid_defs/normal.ron` (harvester threat ON, no attack before tick 20,000) on the first match's
// map with a barracks, a refinery, two harvesters and six riflemen at its gather cell, against a lone static construction centre and two riflemen of player 1 in the far south-west corner. At tick 1000 the
// script orders those two riflemen (slots 12 and 13) to attack the first harvester (slot 4). The AI must
// see the hit on the harvester, call the units at home and defend, with no structure of its own hit.
// `unit_defs` names a FROZEN copy (ai_harvest_raid_defs, made for WP9.3a-1): the shipped definitions of 14-11-2026, the profile above and a match file of
// its own. The ore, harvest, storage, money, production, power and vision numbers are those of `ai_raid_guard`.
Scenario(
    name: "ai_harvest_raid",
    seed: 0xA1_BA5E,
    map: (width: 96, height: 96),
    map_name: Some("m1"),
    unit_defs: Some("ai_harvest_raid_defs"),
    match_file: Some("match.ron"),
    ai: [(player: 0, profile: "normal.ron", seed: 0xA1_0001)],
    buildings: true,
    combat: true,
    targeting: true,
    destruction: true,
    ore: Some((start: 120, max: 160, regrow_amount: 1, regrow_period: 200)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
        travel_cost: 16,
        queue_cost: 100,
        switch_margin: 100,
        recheck_period: 20,
        queue_gap: 3,
        queue_start: 1,
        queue_step: 2,
        queue_rows: 8,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 2000), (43, 1500)]),
    money: Some((credits_per_ore: 1)),
    production: Some((queue_limit: 5, exit_radius: 4, build_speed: (3, 2))),
    power: Some((shortage_floor_permille: 250, defence_cutoff_permille: 1000)),
    vision: Some((legacy_sight_milli: 5000, acquire_needs_sight: true)),
    ticks: 6000,
    commands: [
        (tick: 1000, player: 1, command: OrderAttack(ids: [Id(12, 0), Id(13, 0)], target: (4, 0))),
    ],
)
